    "detailed_description": "<strong>Join Witz and Doobz on their adventure to make a video game in just a week!</strong> With seven different mini-games, you'll have plenty of fun as you try to win the game jam and save the day!<br><br>You'll jump, run, bike, puzzle, and even date your way to success, as fully-voiced cartoon cutscenes bring the fast-paced story to life. Primarily an action platformer with some puzzle, rhythm, and dating sim elements, the total expected playtime is about 20 to 30 minutes. <strong><i>This game is made for all ages!</i></strong><br><br>Truly a jam within a jam, this game was made in a week by me, Kimberly Blais of Mama Makes Games, for the 2022 Epic MegaJam using Unreal Engine 5. Following the theme of &quot;As Above, So Below,&quot; this recursive game about making a game playfully explores the joys and challenges of doing a game jam.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Join Witz and Doobz on their adventure to make a video game in just a week!</strong> With seven different mini-games, you'll have plenty of fun as you try to win the game jam and save the day!<br><br>You'll jump, run, bike, puzzle, and even date your way to success, as fully-voiced cartoon cutscenes bring the fast-paced story to life. Primarily an action platformer with some puzzle, rhythm, and dating sim elements, the total expected playtime is about 20 to 30 minutes. <strong><i>This game is made for all ages!</i></strong><br><br>Truly a jam within a jam, this game was made in a week by me, Kimberly Blais of Mama Makes Games, for the 2022 Epic MegaJam using Unreal Engine 5. Following the theme of &quot;As Above, So Below,&quot; this recursive game about making a game playfully explores the joys and challenges of doing a game jam.",
    "short_description": "Witz and Doobz on their adventure to make a video game through seven different mini-games and funny cartoon cutscenes!",
